  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening International Mediation Capacities - Support to the United Nations Standby Team of Senior Mediation Advisers 2026-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project funds the UN Standby Team of Senior Mediation Advisers (UNSBT) which&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(17, 17, 17); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt; is composed of world-leading mediation experts. These experts can be rapidly deployed by the UN DPPA to &lt;/span&gt;support senior UN, EU and other mediators, &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(17, 17, 17); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;providing advice on a wide range of issues that tend to arise in mediation and preventive diplomacy efforts, including: the design and management of dialogue processes, gender and inclusion, constitutional issues, ceasefire and security arrangements, transitional justice, power-sharing and natural resources. &lt;/span&gt;The UNSBT can also provide support to track II and III mediation efforts anywhere in the world at short notice.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
